    "section": "3.159",
    "heading": "Level 6: Wholeness of Body",
    "lineStart": 3345,
    "lineEnd": 3349
  },
  "section": "3.159",
  "rulesText": "You gain the ability to heal yourself. As a Bonus Action, you can roll your Martial Arts die. You regain a number of Hit Points equal to the number rolled plus your Wisdom modifier (minimum of 1 Hit Point regained).\n\nYou can use this feature a number of times equal to your Wisdom modifier (minimum of once), and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest."
}
